    - target: {fileID: 3546500521746408135, guid: 08df28c273d28684d997ef6ab88d6102, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "OVERDRIVE is a system that grants additional Action Points (AP) at
        the start of your turn. These AP are shown in red instead of the normal green,
        but function the same and can be spent in any way. At the bottom center of
        the screen, you\u2019ll see the OVERDRIVE indicator. At the start of a match,
        it will display \u201COVERDRIVE in 5.\u201D This number decreases by 1 each
        turn. When it reaches 0, you enter OVERDRIVE."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3546500521746408135, guid: 08df28c273d28684d997ef6ab88d6102, type: 3}
