  m_text: "Once in OVERDRIVE, the indicator changes to OVERDRIVE: X, starting at
    1 and increasing by 1 each turn. At the start of your turn, you gain bonus AP
    equal to your current OVERDRIVE level.\n\nFor example:\n\nOVERDRIVE: 1 \u2192
    Gain 1 bonus AP\nOVERDRIVE: 2 \u2192 Gain 2 bonus AP\n\nThis bonus AP is added
    on top of the AP you already have up to a maxium of 9."
